---
import EditorPanel from '../components/editor/EditorPanel.astro';
import CardPreview from '../components/card/CardPreview.astro';
import { DEFAULT_POKEMON_CARD } from '../data/defaultCard';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/editor.css';
import '../styles/card.css';
import '../styles/pokemon-card.css';
import '../styles/collections.css';
import { join } from 'node:path';
import { loadPublishedCollections } from '../lib/publishedContent';

const contentDirectory = join(process.cwd(), 'public', 'conteudo');
const publishedCollections = loadPublishedCollections(contentDirectory, import.meta.env.BASE_URL);
const publishedCollectionsJson = JSON.stringify(publishedCollections).replace(/</g, '\\u003c');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-base-url={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0d0f12" />
    <meta name="description" content="Gerenciador estático de coleções e editor de cartas Pokémon/Jornada." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`} />
    <title>Card Forge — Coleções</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-shell">
      <header class="topbar app-topbar">
        <button class="brand brand-button" type="button" data-action="go-hub" aria-label="Ir para coleções">
          <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
          <div class="brand-copy"><strong>Card Forge</strong><span>Jornada Studio</span></div>
        </button>
        <div class="topbar-actions" data-role="hub-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/jogar"><span class="button-icon">▶</span>Jogar Jornada</a>
          <button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="create-collection"><span class="button-icon">＋</span>Criar coleção</button>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-actions" data-role="collection-actions" hidden>
          <button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="go-hub">← Coleções</button>
          <button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="new-collection-card"><span class="button-icon">＋</span>Nova carta</button>
          <button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="export-content"><span class="button-icon">⇩</span>Salvar conteúdo</button>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-actions" data-role="editor-actions" hidden>
          <button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="back-to-collection">← Coleção</button>
          <button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="save-card"><span class="button-icon">◇</span>Salvar carta</button>
          <button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="export"><span class="button-icon">⇩</span>Exportar PNG</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="hub-view app-view" data-view="hub">
        <section class="hub-hero">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">CARD FORGE / JORNADA</span><h1>Jogar e criar no mesmo lugar</h1><p>Entre em uma Jornada local com 4 jogadores ou gerencie as coleções publicadas do projeto.</p></div>
          <div class="hub-primary-actions">
            <a class="collection-create-card play-card" href="/jogar"><span>▶</span><strong>Jogar Jornada</strong><small>Modo jogue-e-passe com as cartas atuais</small></a>
            <button class="collection-create-card" type="button" data-action="create-collection"><span>＋</span><strong>Gerenciar cartas e coleções</strong><small>Criação protegida pela chave do editor</small></button>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="collections-section">
          <div class="section-title-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">BIBLIOTECA</span><h2>Coleções existentes</h2></div><span class="snapshot-status" data-role="snapshot-status">Carregando conteúdo…</span></div>
          <div class="collections-grid" data-role="collections-grid"></div>
          <div class="empty-hub" data-role="empty-hub" hidden><div class="empty-glyph">✦</div><h3>Nenhuma coleção ainda</h3><p>Crie a primeira coleção para começar. Cada coleção publicada é uma pasta dentro de <code>public/conteudo</code>.</p><button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="create-collection">Criar nova coleção</button></div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <main class="collection-view app-view" data-view="collection" hidden>
        <section class="collection-hero">
          <button class="back-link" type="button" data-action="go-hub">← Hub de coleções</button>
          <div class="collection-title-row">
            <div><span class="collection-code" data-role="collection-code">SET</span><h1 data-role="collection-name">Coleção</h1><p><span class="collection-size-pill">Composição livre</span> · <span data-role="collection-progress">0 cartas</span></p></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="category-capacity-panel"><div class="capacity-grid" data-role="capacity-grid"></div></section>
        <section class="collection-cards-section">
          <div class="section-title-row collection-toolbar">
            <div><span class="eyebrow">CARTAS</span><h2>Cartas da coleção</h2></div>
            <div class="toolbar-actions"><select data-role="category-filter"><option value="all">Todas as categorias</option></select><button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="new-collection-card">＋ Nova carta</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="collection-card-grid" data-role="collection-card-grid"></div>
          <div class="empty-collection" data-role="empty-collection" hidden><p>Esta coleção ainda não tem cartas.</p><button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="new-collection-card">Criar primeira carta</button></div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <main class="editor-view app-view" data-view="editor" hidden>
        <div class="editor-context-bar"><button class="back-link" type="button" data-action="back-to-collection">← Voltar</button><span data-role="editor-collection-context">Coleção</span><strong data-role="editor-card-number">001/140</strong></div>
        <div class="workspace">
          <EditorPanel card={DEFAULT_POKEMON_CARD} />
          <section class="preview-column" aria-label="Preview da carta">
            <div class="preview-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PREVIEW EM TEMPO REAL</span><h2 data-role="preview-title">Carta Pokémon</h2><p>Composição fixa 63 × 88, escalada apenas para visualização.</p></div><div class="preview-tools"><span class="scale-chip" data-role="preview-scale">100%</span><span class="scale-chip">630 × 880 base</span></div></div>
            <div class="preview-stage"><div class="card-scale-box"><CardPreview /></div></div>
            <p class="preview-footnote"><span>↳</span> A exportação captura somente o template selecionado em 1260 × 1760 px. A arte pode ser arrastada diretamente na carta para refinar o enquadramento.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <div class="toast-region" data-role="toast-region" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

    <dialog class="confirm-dialog collection-dialog" data-role="create-collection-dialog">
      <form method="dialog" class="dialog-inner" data-role="create-collection-form">
        <span class="eyebrow">NOVA COLEÇÃO</span><h3>Criar coleção</h3><p>Escolha o nome. A coleção não possui limite de cartas e a sigla será gerada automaticamente.</p>
        <label class="dialog-field"><span>Nome da coleção</span><input data-role="new-collection-name" maxlength="48" placeholder="Ex.: Evoluções de Kanto" required /></label>
        <div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button subtle" value="cancel">Cancelar</button><button class="button primary" value="default" data-action="confirm-create-collection">Criar coleção</button></div>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <dialog class="confirm-dialog collection-dialog" data-role="new-card-dialog">
      <div class="dialog-inner"><span class="eyebrow">NOVA CARTA</span><h3>Escolha a categoria</h3><p>A numeração será calculada automaticamente sem alterar a ordem das cartas já criadas.</p><div class="new-card-category-grid" data-role="new-card-category-grid"></div><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="cancel-new">Cancelar</button></div></div>
    </dialog>

    <dialog class="confirm-dialog" data-role="delete-card-dialog"><div class="dialog-inner"><h3>Excluir esta carta?</h3><p>A coleção será renumerada automaticamente. Full Arts extras também podem mudar de número para manter a ordem oficial.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="button subtle" type="button" data-action="cancel-delete-card">Cancelar</button><button class="button danger" type="button" data-action="confirm-delete-card">Excluir</button></div></div></dialog>

    <dialog class="card-zoom-dialog" data-role="card-zoom-dialog">
      <div class="card-zoom-shell">
        <button class="card-zoom-close" type="button" data-action="close-card-zoom" aria-label="Fechar visualização">×</button>
        <div class="card-zoom-stage" data-role="card-zoom-stage"></div>
        <div class="card-zoom-footer">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">VISUALIZAÇÃO</span><strong data-role="card-zoom-title">Carta</strong></div>
          <button class="button primary" type="button" data-action="edit-zoom-card">Editar carta</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <script is:inline id="published-collections" type="application/json" set:html={publishedCollectionsJson}></script>
    <script src="../scripts/editor.ts"></script>
  </body>
</html>
